# XSH telldir()
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XSH.telldir.001
anchor     functions/telldir.html#DESCRIPTION
class      conditional
when       XSI
since      2001
says       In a directory of 20 files, telldir() at the start (l0) and after 7
           entries (l1) give positions that seekdir() returns to, readdir()
           then giving the entries that followed them; telldir() right
           after seekdir(d, l) returns l, for each.
test       t/001-telldir.c
